enum CustomerFactStatus {
  /// Proposed and not in use. A CHECK keeps an unconfirmed entry out of ACTIVE.
  SUGGESTED
  ACTIVE
  /// Replaced by a newer entry for the same subject; kept, because how a fact changed is part of it.
  SUPERSEDED
  EXPIRED
